<title>UK: TENNIS-NOTTINGHAM OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NOTTINGHAM OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results at</p>
<p>the Nottingham Open men's grass-court tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Sandon Stolle (Australia) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat 4-Tim Henman (Britain)</p>
<p>6-4 2-6 6-4</p>
</text>
